<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5191] Misleading docker image name in K8 specification</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5191</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There seems to be an inconsistency between the&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hub.docker.com/u/zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Zeppelin image published on Docker hub&lt;/a&gt;&#160;and the Zeppelin image referenced in the&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/zeppelin/master/k8s/zeppelin-server.yaml&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;config file&lt;/a&gt;&#160;on the Zeppelin homepage.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/commit/90bfb7209bc74470e2cc33a0b71369d2e473e2f6#diff-ff3de7f03fa72c16dc83aa18c00d725d0f6318774bba6adc01ea45242c2740dc&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;this commit&lt;/a&gt;&#160;the image in the config file has been changed from&#160;&lt;tt&gt;zeppelin&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;to&#160;&lt;tt&gt;zeppelin-server&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;(as well as some other changes have been implemented). It looks like that the new image has not yet been pushed to Docker hub.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
